Senior Product Manager &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are the platform turning browsing into shopping&lt;/strong&gt;. We connect 200 million shoppers with deals they love while boosting local sales for hundreds of top retailers and brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We help consumers save time and money while making smart shopping decisions, and we support retailers and brands in engaging customers from online research to in-store purchases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2024, Shopfully joined forces with the North American company &lt;a href=&quot;https://corp.flipp.com/&quot;&gt;Flipp&lt;/a&gt;, creating a global leader in the sector. Together, we reach 400 million households and serve over 1,000 top retailers and brands across 27 markets, including Europe, Canada, the USA, Latin America, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;spark&lt;/strong&gt; your growth with us?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE LOOK FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; 🦄&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flipp + Shopfully’s Product team focuses on driving adoption and revenue of our products by identifying the biggest market opportunities, building the case for investing in them, and shipping solutions with engineering, all while representing the voice of our merchant customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Product Manager is a senior, commercially minded product leader who already understands digital advertising. This role requires a strong strategic thinker with good business sense and solid hands-on product skills who leads opportunity identification, builds decision-ready business cases, and works with engineering to ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with Sales, Engineering, Data, and Marketing teams across markets to align on key business objectives. By combining market insight, customer feedback, and industry trends, you will make sure our products resonate with merchants and drive growth. We’re looking for someone who can ramp up quickly and contribute independently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO &lt;/strong&gt;🏄&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Understanding and Opportunity Identification&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Marketing, Sales Engineering and customer-facing teams to understand customer needs and prioritize the opportunities that matter most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find the highest-leverage areas to invest in, and weigh customer demand against our resources, capabilities and strategic direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex questions into clear priorities. For example: how do we create more value for retail partners as their strategies move toward e-commerce? How do we find and build opportunities at scale as products launch in new markets?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Cases and Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build business cases that size opportunities, weigh revenue trade-offs, and structure a clear recommendation so leadership can make a decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your recommendations, and be ready to explain them and adapt them as you learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the strategy for how our products differentiate from competitors in the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and Finance on pricing and monetization so our offering stays cohesive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Discovery and Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery with merchants, advertisers, and internal teams to define problems worth solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise ruthlessly, balancing revenue impact, effort, and strategic fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on with engineering to define requirements and ship, from alpha and testing through broad launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and Marketing on launch timing and readiness, and run retrospectives on past launches to improve future ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alignment and Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate cross-functional alignment (Engineering, Data, Sales, Marketing, Content) with a shared focus on goals and timing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across markets and levels of seniority, including senior leadership, with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track progress and impact of product initiatives and communicate results clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with industry analysts, partners, and customers, and represent Flipp + Shopfully at conferences and industry events where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL NEED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;🪄&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital advertising foundations:&lt;/strong&gt; supply vs. demand, how exchanges, SSPs, and DSPs work, programmatic bidding, pricing models (CPM, CPC, CPV), and fill rate and yield. Ideally gained in ad tech, a retail media network, a publisher, or a marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building business cases: sizing opportunities, weighing revenue trade-offs, and structuring recommendations for decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy: you figure things out, own the outcome and don’t need close management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine excitement about using AI tools and rethinking how work gets done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on product skills: discovery, prioritisation, and working with engineering to ship, not only strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder management, with the confidence to work across markets and levels of seniority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A scrappy, curious and confident approach. You’re hungry to make an impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 At our company, we value diversity and actively encourage it — we believe a variety of perspectives and backgrounds makes us stronger. We focus on potential rather than on having a “perfect” CV. If this role excites you and you believe you could grow into it — even if you don’t tick every single box in the requirements — we’d love to hear from you!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎆&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retail, CPG, or retail media background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-market experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can speak Italian or German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LOCATION 🌐&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we have offices in Milan, Berlin, Barcelona, you can benefit from our flexible hybrid model (full remote available), empowering you to work where you&#39;re most effective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOURS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;⏰&lt;br&gt;Your manager and several partner teams are in North America, so you’ll need to be flexible about working some later hours, beyond a standard 9-5 CET.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL FIND AT SHOPFULLY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; 🤗&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 An opportunity to thrive in a rapidly scaling multinational company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🕶️ A vibrant, informal, and inclusive work environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 We champion autonomy, flexibility, and a hybrid work model, empowering you to own your work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 Access to learning opportunities and regular feedback sessions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍓 Enjoy our central, modern offices featuring fresh snacks, coffee (including vegan options!), and ergonomic setups&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎉 Engage in meaningful team events: offsites, happy hours, company parties and celebrations that unite us beyond daily tasks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💻We provide all the necessary equipment for you to work effectively and set up your workspace, wherever you are&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧰 Benefit from additional country-specific advantages based on local contracts and practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE &lt;/strong&gt;💜&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of 450 people (and counting!), from 30 different nationalities. We’re on a mission to innovate, and we believe the key to that is seeing the world through a variety of perspectives. That’s why building a more diverse team, as well as bringing in even more talent, is so important for us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO FEEL AT HOME 🛋️ IN SHOPFULLY YOU NEED 🎯&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Progress Over Perfection&lt;/strong&gt;: We move forward. Always. In a fast-moving world, speed with purpose beats certainty without action. Momentum matters—not for its own sake, but because it drives results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarity Through Transparency&lt;/strong&gt;: We bring each other along. We work in teams, not silos. Transparency gives context, and context enables action. That means we share decisions early, publish work in progress, and document outcomes so others can learn, move faster, and build better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn Loudly&lt;/strong&gt;: We grow by doing and by daring. Big bets unlock big breakthroughs. But real innovation demands risk, and risk always carries the possibility of failure. That’s not a flaw. It’s the price of ambition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenge with Empathy&lt;/strong&gt;: We speak up, even when it’s hard—because candor shows care, and leads to better outcomes. Listening deeply is how we grow. Disagreeing openly is how we build trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Always Build Better: We are builders—of products, systems, and ideas. But more than that, we are builders of better. Better has no finish line. It’s a mindset.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you choose to apply for this specific job position and submit your application, which may include personal data such as your identifying details, contact information, curriculum vitae, cover letter, professional qualifications, and/or employment history, please be informed that your data may be shared with our Affiliates*, including Offerista Group GmbH and Flipp Operations Inc. The aforementioned entities will act as joint controllers for the limited purpose of intra-group sharing related to the evaluation of candidates’ applications. This means that your data may be processed by the Affiliate to assess your application and, if deemed suitable, to contact you regarding potential employment opportunities. However, please note that from the moment an Affiliate initiates direct contact with you and engages in any further processing of your personal data beyond the initial intra-group sharing for evaluation purposes, such Affiliate shall act as an independent data controller. In such cases, the processing of your personal data will be subject to the specific privacy policies that can be found&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://shopfully.com/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;* Affiliates shall mean any entity that directly or indirectly controls, is controlled by or is under common control with ShopFully SpA and its Affiliates’ subsidiaries, meaning any entity which is directly or indirectly controlled by the Affiliates.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Support You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Total Rewards philosophy is to ensure that you are rewarded for impact, take part in accelerated career growth, thrive with highly flexible benefits, and are empowered to do your best work in a remote-first environment. In alignment with our overall Total Rewards Philosophy, we believe compensation should be fair, clear, consistent, and aligned to growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Italy Base Hiring Range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€50.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€70.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Product

Senior Fullstack Engineer - Java, React (x/f/m) &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Doctolib&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doctolib Connect is a secure medical communication app designed for healthcare professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 1M healthcare professionals use Doctolib Connect to discuss and coordinate patient care with colleagues both within and beyond their organizational walls. Today, Doctolib Connect is the largest medical network in Europe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2013, Doctolib has been striving for a healthier world by providing new-generation technology. With more than 2,800 employees across France, Italy, Germany and the Netherlands, Doctolib improves the daily lives of healthcare professionals and serves more than 80 million Europeans, offering a fast, frictionless, and secure journey for all their care needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Fullstack Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to join the &lt;strong&gt;Doctolib Connect &lt;/strong&gt;team in &lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam, Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Fullstack Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, your mission will be to work on &lt;strong&gt;web features&lt;/strong&gt; for our secure medical communication solutions that enable healthcare professionals to discuss and coordinate patient care with colleagues both within and beyond their organizational walls. You will be working in a feature team developing a product that powers Europe&#39;s largest medical network with over 1M healthcare professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib involves building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients. We work in feature teams in an agile environment, while collaborating with product, design, and business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend (React): building and owning web features, reviewing code and setting quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend and APIs (Java): API-focused work that supports the frontend and the features it owns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical leadership and delivery ownership: estimates, delivery plans, breaking down projects, giving the team context, accountability for results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration and team practices: working with the PM and Designer, supporting ways of working and processes, mentoring other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the full development lifecycle, including stakeholder communication and production issue debugging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our tech environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to the country and healthcare specialty requirements. To address these challenges, we are modularizing our platform run in a distributed architecture through reusable components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of React, TypeScript, Java, Rails, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; and learn about our first AI hackathon &lt;a href=&quot;https://medium.com/doctolib/building-for-healthcare-our-first-ai-hackathon-aa9d10d1a250&quot;&gt;here!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years experience working as fullstack software engineer on user facing applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with React, Typescript and one or more of our backend technologies (Java, Rails...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience running software on cloud infrastructure, ideally AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working with database technologies, preferably JPA, MySQL, MongoDB and Elasticsearch/Opensearch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy figuring out why things work, not just that they work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme through our partner Allianz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 days of annual leave per year (and the ability to accrue more days on your work anniversary!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast and lunch plan every day on-site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike lease scheme with our partner Lease a Bike, 35% price below the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted membership with Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous training programs on all key competencies (English, soft skills, expertise)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reimbursement of public transportation if you live outside the Amsterdam highway ring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parent Care Program:&amp;nbsp; Various initiatives supporting parenthood, including 100% paid parental leave up to 16 weeks, including bonuses, for mothers and up to 5 weeks for the co-parent, flexible return and 3 days of leave per year for child sickness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support for international mobilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Design Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g. pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://media.doctolib.com/image/upload/v1678356494/legal/Career-Privacy-Policy-Feb-23-EN.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Engineering  Amsterdam

(Senior) Consultant* - SEPA-Payments &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Standort: Frankfurt, Düsseldorf, Berlin, München (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Practice Area&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Banking &amp;amp; Payments | Anstellungsart: Unbefristet&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestalte mit uns die Zukunft des Zahlungsverkehrs – von SEPA-Prozessen und ISO-20022-Nachrichten bis hin zu modernen, AI-gestützten Arbeitsweisen.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als (Senior) Consultant* – SEPA Payments begleitest Du anspruchsvolle Beratungsprojekte im Zahlungsverkehr und unterstützt unsere Kunden entlang des gesamten Projektzyklus – von der Business Analyse und Fachkonzeption über das Testing bis hin zur Implementierung. Dabei bringst Du Deine Payments-Expertise ein und &lt;strong&gt;nutzt geeignete, freigegebene AI-Tools und AI-gestützte Workflows, um Analysen, Qualität und Produktivität zu verbessern – stets mit menschlicher Beurteilung und unter Berücksichtigung geltender Responsible-AI-Leitplanken.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mit zunehmender Projekterfahrung übernimmst Du mehr Verantwortung für Deine Themen bis hin zur Leitung von Teilprojekten und kleineren Projektteams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du begleitest anspruchsvolle Beratungsprojekte im Zahlungsverkehr von der Business Analyse und Fachkonzeption über das Testing bis hin zur engen Begleitung der Implementierung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest kundenorientiert und bringst Deine eigenen Erfahrungen sowie die Expertise Deiner Capco-Kolleg*innen wirkungsvoll in die Projektarbeit ein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du analysierst fachliche Anforderungen und Payments-Prozesse und entwickelst gemeinsam mit unseren Kunden tragfähige Lösungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du übernimmst zunehmend Verantwortung für Deine Themen bis hin zur Leitung von Teilprojekten und kleineren Projektteams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du nutzt freigegebene AI-Tools, Automatisierung und AI-gestützte Workflows dort, wo sie einen praktischen Mehrwert für Geschwindigkeit, Qualität oder Erkenntnisgewinn bieten, und stellst durch Review, menschliche Beurteilung und definierte Eskalationswege eine verantwortungsvolle Nutzung sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast ein großes Interesse an (SEPA-)Payments und möchtest Deine Kenntnisse in diesem hochaktuellen Themenfeld einbringen und weiter ausbauen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begriffe und Nachrichtenformate wie pain, pacs und camt sind Dir vertraut; idealerweise kennst Du zudem SEPA-Begriffe und -Prozesse wie SCL, STEP2, SCT, SDD, Clearing &amp;amp; Settlement und R-Transaktionen.&lt;/li&gt;
